Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 20:11:08 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 21/24] feat(appstore): warn before the pnpm rebuild downloads
 packages again

The first App Store operation after the switch to pnpm rebuilds an
npm-built node_modules and downloads every package that the installed
plugins and webapps use again, which costs on a metered connection.
The App Store now says so, with the number of packages, until the
rebuild has happened.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Tc38h7UaqvAcPgWkZK3Fcj
